  "question": "Build a complete, beautiful three.js kinetic sculpture for a developer livestream.\nReturn ONLY a complete HTML document, no Markdown fences and no explanation.\nUse THREE from the provided classic script ./vendor/three.min.js (three.js 0.160.1).\nNo other imports, dependencies, network calls, external assets, logos, people, or eval.\n\nThe artwork: a small luminous cobalt core with three orbiting, tilted metallic rings,\nwarm copper accents, and hundreds of tiny particles that travel in coherent orbital\npaths. It should feel like a physical museum sculpture, not a random particle cloud.\nCreate depth through geometry, perspective, materials, and lighting. Use a dark navy\nbackground. Fill the available 16:9 viewport with a legible, balanced composition.\nAvoid huge white lighting hotspots. Use simple procedural geometry and bounded GPU work.\n\nInclude working native Pause/Resume and Reset view buttons, a speed range slider,\nmouse or pointer drag to orbit the view, responsive resize, and a clear title.\nRespect prefers-reduced-motion by starting paused. Show an explicit readable error\nif WebGL is unavailable. Keep all text at least 16px, with strong contrast and visible\nkeyboard focus. Use requestAnimationFrame, cap pixel ratio at 2, and no shadows or\npostprocessing. Make it run offline when served alongside the provided three.js file.\nDon't assume OrbitControls or any add-ons are available. Include all implementation\ninside this single document. Aim for a polished scene, not a technical wireframe.\nKeep the implementation concise: at most 250 lines and 18,000 characters of HTML.\n",
  "answer": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Cobalt Orrery \u2014 Kinetic Sculpture</title>\n<style>\n  :root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden;background:#060d1d;color:#edf3ff}\n  canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;outline:none}\n  canvas.dragging{cursor:grabbing}\n  canvas:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8fb2ff;outline-offset:-4px}\n  header{position:fixed;top:24px;left:28px;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;text-shadow:0 2px 16px #000}\n  h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(24px,2.3vw,38px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em}\n  header p{margin:7px 0 0;color:#a9b9d5;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}\n  .panel{position:fixed;z-index:3;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #344463;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(8,16,32,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);font-size:16px;white-space:nowrap}\n  button{min-height:42px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #526583;border-radius:9px;background:#15213a;color:#f4f7ff;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}\n  button:hover{background:#203152;border-color:#8fa8d2}\n  button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a9c4ff;outline-offset:3px}\n  .speed{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 5px}\n  input[type=range]{width:130px;accent-color:#78a0ff;cursor:pointer}\n  output{min-width:40px;color:#c9d9f7;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  #error{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:10;display:none;place-items:center;padding:30px;background:#060d1d;text-align:center}\n  #error div{max-width:620px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6}\n  #error strong{display:block;font-size:28px;color:#ffb59d;margin-bottom:12px}\n  @media(max-width:650px){header{top:18px;left:20px}.panel{bottom:14px;gap:8px;padding:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;width:calc(100% - 24px)}input[type=range]{width:100px}button{padding:8px 12px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"view\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Interactive cobalt kinetic sculpture. Drag or use arrow keys to orbit; use plus and minus to zoom.\"></canvas>\n<header><h1>Cobalt Orrery</h1><p>A kinetic study in metal and light</p></header>\n<div class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Sculpture controls\">\n  <button id=\"toggle\" type=\"button\">Pause</button>\n  <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">Reset view</button>\n  <label class=\"speed\" for=\"speed\">Speed <input id=\"speed\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\"><output id=\"rate\" for=\"speed\">1.0\u00d7</output></label>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\" role=\"alert\"><div><strong>WebGL is unavailable</strong>This sculpture needs WebGL. Please enable hardware acceleration or open this page in a browser with WebGL support.</div></div>\n<noscript><div style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#060d1d;font-size:20px;padding:30px\">JavaScript is required to display this sculpture.</div></noscript>\n<script src=\"./vendor/three.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const canvas=document.getElementById('view'),error=document.getElementById('error');\n  if(!window.THREE){error.style.display='grid';return;}\n  let renderer;\n  try{renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({canvas,antialias:true,powerPreference:'high-performance'});}\n  catch(e){error.style.display='grid';return;}\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2));\n  renderer.setClearColor(0x060d1d);\n  renderer.outputColorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n  renderer.toneMapping=THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\n  renderer.toneMappingExposure=1.05;\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.fog=new THREE.FogExp2(0x060d1d,.026);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(42,1,.1,60);\n  const target=new THREE.Vector3(0,-.15,0);\n  let theta=.48,phi=1.39,radius=11.2;\n  function positionCamera(){\n    camera.position.set(radius*Math.sin(phi)*Math.sin(theta),target.y+radius*Math.cos(phi),radius*Math.sin(phi)*Math.cos(theta));\n    camera.lookAt(target);\n  }\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0x8ca8ff,0x160f16,1.25));\n  const warm=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffc397,2.1);warm.position.set(4,6,5);scene.add(warm);\n  const cool=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x6688ff,1.8);cool.position.set(-5,2,-3);scene.add(cool);\n  const coreLight=new THREE.PointLight(0x3266ff,16,7,2);coreLight.position.set(0,.2,0);scene.add(coreLight);\n  const copperLight=new THREE.PointLight(0xff8b4f,9,7,2);copperLight.position.set(3,-1,2);scene.add(copperLight);\n  const sculpture=new THREE.Group();scene.add(sculpture);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x788aa9,metalness:.82,roughness:.24});\n  const copper=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xc87946,metalness:.8,roughness:.25,emissive:0x321006,emissiveIntensity:.18});\n  const darkMetal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x111b2d,metalness:.7,roughness:.35});\n  const coreMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x174ee8,emissive:0x064dff,emissiveIntensity:1.45,metalness:.3,roughness:.22});\n  const core=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.38,40,28),coreMat);sculpture.add(core);\n  const glow=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.5,28,20),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0x286cff,transparent:true,opacity:.13,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false}));sculpture.add(glow);\n  const equator=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(.48,.018,8,64),copper);equator.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;sculpture.add(equator);\n  const orbitSystems=[];\n  const configs=[\n    {r:1.75,tilt:[.72,.18,.12],speed:.34,color:0x72a1ff},\n    {r:2.35,tilt:[1.22,-.55,.62],speed:-.23,color:0xffb079},\n    {r:3.02,tilt:[.42,.86,-.3],speed:.16,color:0x83aaff}\n  ];\n  configs.forEach((cfg,index)=>{\n    const pivot=new THREE.Group();pivot.rotation.set(...cfg.tilt);sculpture.add(pivot);\n    pivot.add(new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(cfg.r,.055,12,160),metal));\n    for(let j=0;j<3;j++){\n      const arc=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(cfg.r,.074,10,30,.48),copper);\n      arc.rotation.z=j*Math.PI*2/3+index*.37;pivot.add(arc);\n    }\n    const bead=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.11,18,12),copper);pivot.add(bead);\n    const count=240,positions=new Float32Array(count*3),colors=new Float32Array(count*3),phases=new Float32Array(count),radii=new Float32Array(count),heights=new Float32Array(count);\n    const blue=new THREE.Color(cfg.color),amber=new THREE.Color(0xffa86f);\n    for(let i=0;i<count;i++){\n      phases[i]=i/count*Math.PI*2+.025*Math.sin(i*2.39);\n      radii[i]=cfg.r+.075*Math.sin(i*1.73);\n      heights[i]=.052*Math.cos(i*2.17);\n      const c=i%9===0?amber:blue;\n      colors[i*3]=c.r;colors[i*3+1]=c.g;colors[i*3+2]=c.b;\n    }\n    const geometry=new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n    geometry.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions,3).setUsage(THREE.DynamicDrawUsage));\n    geometry.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors,3));\n    const points=new THREE.Points(geometry,new THREE.PointsMaterial({size:.043,vertexColors:true,transparent:true,opacity:.85,blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false,sizeAttenuation:true}));\n    pivot.add(points);\n    orbitSystems.push({pivot,cfg,bead,positions,phases,radii,heights,geometry,baseX:cfg.tilt[0],baseY:cfg.tilt[1]});\n  });\n  const stem=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(.035,.06,2.95,16),copper);stem.position.y=-1.78;scene.add(stem);\n  const base=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2.05,2.2,.22,80),darkMetal);base.position.y=-3.3;scene.add(base);\n  const lip=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(2.08,.035,10,100),copper);lip.rotation.x=Math.PI/2;lip.position.y=-3.19;scene.add(lip);\n  const lowerBase=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.72,1.85,.16,64),metal);lowerBase.position.y=-3.48;scene.add(lowerBase);\n  const floor=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CircleGeometry(16,72),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x070e1b,roughness:.86,metalness:.12}));\n  floor.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;floor.position.y=-3.57;scene.add(floor);\n  function updateScene(t){\n    orbitSystems.forEach((o,i)=>{\n      o.pivot.rotation.x=o.baseX+Math.sin(t*.15+i)*.055;\n      o.pivot.rotation.y=o.baseY+Math.sin(t*.12+i*1.7)*.09;\n      for(let j=0;j<o.phases.length;j++){\n        const a=o.phases[j]+t*o.cfg.speed;\n        const r=o.radii[j]+.018*Math.sin(a*3+t*.35);\n        o.positions[j*3]=Math.cos(a)*r;\n        o.positions[j*3+1]=Math.sin(a)*r;\n        o.positions[j*3+2]=o.heights[j]+.025*Math.sin(a*2+t*.25);\n      }\n      o.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate=true;\n      const a=t*o.cfg.speed*1.8+i*2.1;\n      o.bead.position.set(Math.cos(a)*o.cfg.r,Math.sin(a)*o.cfg.r,0);\n    });\n    const pulse=1+Math.sin(t*1.7)*.025;\n    core.scale.setScalar(pulse);glow.scale.setScalar(1+Math.sin(t*1.35)*.07);\n    coreMat.emissiveIntensity=1.4+Math.sin(t*1.4)*.12;\n  }\n  const reduced=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');\n  let paused=reduced.matches,speed=1,time=0,last=performance.now(),dragging=false,px=0,py=0;\n  const toggle=document.getElementById('toggle');\n  toggle.textContent=paused?'Resume':'Pause';\n  toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));\n  toggle.addEventListener('click',()=>{paused=!paused;toggle.textContent=paused?'Resume':'Pause';toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));});\n  document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{theta=.48;phi=1.39;radius=11.2;positionCamera();});\n  const slider=document.getElementById('speed'),rate=document.getElementById('rate');\n  slider.addEventListener('input',()=>{speed=Number(slider.value);rate.value=speed.toFixed(1)+'\u00d7';rate.textContent=rate.value;});\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{dragging=true;px=e.clientX;py=e.clientY;canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);canvas.classList.add('dragging');});\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{\n    if(!dragging)return;\n    theta-=(e.clientX-px)*.006;phi=Math.max(.3,Math.min(2.75,phi+(e.clientY-py)*.006));\n    px=e.clientX;py=e.clientY;positionCamera();\n  });\n  function endDrag(){dragging=false;canvas.classList.remove('dragging');}\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointerup',endDrag);canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel',endDrag);\n  canvas.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{e.preventDefault();radius=Math.max(7,Math.min(17,radius+e.deltaY*.008));positionCamera();},{passive:false});\n  canvas.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n    let used=true;\n    if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')theta-=.1;else if(e.key==='ArrowRight')theta+=.1;\n    else if(e.key==='ArrowUp')phi=Math.max(.3,phi-.1);else if(e.key==='ArrowDown')phi=Math.min(2.75,phi+.1);\n    else if(e.key==='+'||e.key==='=')radius=Math.max(7,radius-.5);else if(e.key==='-')radius=Math.min(17,radius+.5);else used=false;\n    if(used){e.preventDefault();positionCamera();}\n  });\n  function resize(){\n    const w=window.innerWidth,h=window.innerHeight;\n    renderer.setSize(w,h,false);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.fov=camera.aspect<1?58:42;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize',resize);resize();positionCamera();updateScene(0);\n  function frame(now){\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n    const dt=Math.min((now-last)/1000,.05);last=now;\n    if(!paused){time+=dt*speed;updateScene(time);}\n    renderer.render(scene,camera);\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
